<title>FRANCE: SWIMMING-PANKRATOV BREAKS 50 METRES BUTTERFLY WORLD RECORD.</title>
<headline>SWIMMING-PANKRATOV BREAKS 50 METRES BUTTERFLY WORLD RECORD.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian Denis Pankratov set a 50 metres butterfly shortcourse swimming world record in 23.35 seconds at a World Cup meeting on Saturday.</p>
<p>Pankratov beat the previous best mark of 23.45 set by Briton Mark Foster in December 1995 in Sheffield, England.</p>
